      "heading": "Introduction",
      "level": 1,
      "text": "Bronze Armor is a Black Forest-tier armor. Compared with the other armor set available in the Bronze Age, the Troll Set, it provides higher armor values but reduces the player's movement speed. There is no set bonus for bronze armor.\nThis set is the tier above Rag Armor and Leather Armor and is replaced by Root Set or Iron Armor."
